     [38;5;255mthrough forest soils, linking root systems in what some call the wood wide web. Old-growth forests store [38;5;15m
     [38;5;255mcenturies of carbon in massive trunks and deep soils. Fire-adapted ecosystems like lodgepole pine forests depend [38;5;15m
     [38;5;255mon periodic burns to release seeds. Mangrove forests straddle saltwater and freshwater, shielding coastlines [38;5;15m
     [38;5;255mfrom storm surges. Boreal forests form a vast green belt circling the northern hemisphere across Canada, Russia, [38;5;15m
     [38;5;255mand Scandinavia. Agroforestry blends crops with trees to restore degraded land and improve yields. Urban forests [38;5;15m
     [38;5;255mcool city heat islands and filter airborne pollutants. Logging, agriculture, and development continue to clear [38;5;15m
